# The two controllers of the walk-style sampler hold every style's clips:
# about 90 MB of text that is only there to choose from. They are written by
# `scripts/cass.sh gaits styles` and are not committed. The prefab beside
# them is, so that the cass-gaits variant keeps its place for it; the bake
# points the prefab at the controllers it has just written.
*.controller
*.controller.meta
